@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `pti-nouns`
IMPORT `pti-part1-definitions`
IMPORT `pti-part4-conditions`
IMPORT `pti-part2-benefits`
IMPORT `pti-part3-exclusions`
IMPORT `pti-part5-claims`
IMPORT `pti-assessment`

-- FIXTURES for the tests modules: people, places, schedules, policies, events, lines and
-- claims. No assertion lives here.
--
-- EVERY MONEY FIGURE BELOW IS HYPOTHETICAL. The Rules print no sum insured, limit, premium or
-- co-payment rate (they are figures of the certificate and of Appendix 01, which is not in
-- the published file), so the tests supply round figures chosen to make the arithmetic
-- visible. The RULES the tests check (100% of the sum insured, the short-period fractions,
-- 80%, 30/45/15/7/30/90/365/180/120 days, 104 weeks, 24 hours, ages 15 days, 14, 18 and 65,
-- 50%, 5 km) are the Rules' own.
--
-- The standard period of insurance runs 1 January to 31 December 2026; the premium was
-- received on 20 December 2025, so cover takes effect on 1 January 2026.

§ `Fixtures`

§§ `Doctors and places`

`a licensed doctor` MEANS
    `The doctor who gave the order` WITH
        `licensed, and practising within the licence, under the law of the country of treatment` IS TRUE
        `the insured person, or a parent, sibling, spouse or child of the insured person`       IS FALSE

`the insured person's own father, a licensed doctor` MEANS
    `The doctor who gave the order` WITH
        `licensed, and practising within the licence, under the law of the country of treatment` IS TRUE
        `the insured person, or a parent, sibling, spouse or child of the insured person`       IS TRUE

GIVEN g IS A `A country group`
      act IS A `A main activity of a place`
      net IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The place of treatment`
`a licensed place in` g `mainly for` act `, in the network:` net MEANS
    `The place of treatment` WITH
        `the insured person's home`                                     IS FALSE
        `licensed and recognised by the law of the country where it is` IS TRUE
        `its main activity`                                             IS act
        `the country group`                                             IS g
        `in PTI's direct-billing hospital network (Appendix 04)`        IS net

`a hospital in Vietnam` MEANS
    `a licensed place in` `Vietnam` `mainly for` `examining and treating patients` `, in the network:` FALSE

`a network hospital in Vietnam` MEANS
    `a licensed place in` `Vietnam` `mainly for` `examining and treating patients` `, in the network:` TRUE

`a hospital in another Asian country` MEANS
    `a licensed place in` `another country in Asia` `mainly for` `examining and treating patients` `, in the network:` FALSE

`a hospital outside Asia` MEANS
    `a licensed place in` `a country outside Asia` `mainly for` `examining and treating patients` `, in the network:` FALSE

`a licensed acupuncture clinic in Vietnam` MEANS
    `a licensed place in` `Vietnam` `mainly for` `spa, cosmetic, massage, sauna, acupuncture or acupressure services` `, in the network:` FALSE

`a licensed psychiatric hospital in Vietnam` MEANS
    `a licensed place in` `Vietnam` `mainly for` `treatment of mental disorders` `, in the network:` FALSE

`a convalescent home in Vietnam` MEANS
    `a licensed place in` `Vietnam` `mainly for` `rest or convalescence` `, in the network:` FALSE

`the insured person's home in Vietnam` MEANS
    `The place of treatment` WITH
        `the insured person's home`                                     IS TRUE
        `licensed and recognised by the law of the country where it is` IS FALSE
        `its main activity`                                             IS `examining and treating patients`
        `the country group`                                             IS `Vietnam`
        `in PTI's direct-billing hospital network (Appendix 04)`        IS FALSE

§§ `People`

GIVEN dob IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The insured person`
`a person born on` dob MEANS
    `The insured person` WITH
        `date of birth`                                IS dob
        `living and working in Vietnam`                IS TRUE
        `suffering from a mental illness`              IS FALSE
        `suffering from leprosy`                       IS FALSE
        `suffering from epilepsy`                      IS FALSE
        `suffering from cancer`                        IS FALSE
        `degree of permanent disablement, in per cent` IS 0

`the insured person` MEANS `a person born on` (YMD 1990 6 15)

GIVEN `mental` IS A BOOLEAN
      `leprosy` IS A BOOLEAN
      `epilepsy` IS A BOOLEAN
      `cancer` IS A BOOLEAN
      `disablement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The insured person`
`a person born in 1990 with mental illness:` `mental` `, leprosy:` `leprosy` `, epilepsy:` `epilepsy` `, cancer:` `cancer` `, disablement:` `disablement` MEANS
    `The insured person` WITH
        `date of birth`                                IS YMD 1990 6 15
        `living and working in Vietnam`                IS TRUE
        `suffering from a mental illness`              IS `mental`
        `suffering from leprosy`                       IS `leprosy`
        `suffering from epilepsy`                      IS `epilepsy`
        `suffering from cancer`                        IS `cancer`
        `degree of permanent disablement, in per cent` IS `disablement`

`a person who lives abroad` MEANS
    `The insured person` WITH
        `date of birth`                                IS YMD 1990 6 15
        `living and working in Vietnam`                IS FALSE
        `suffering from a mental illness`              IS FALSE
        `suffering from leprosy`                       IS FALSE
        `suffering from epilepsy`                      IS FALSE
        `suffering from cancer`                        IS FALSE
        `degree of permanent disablement, in per cent` IS 0

§§ `Schedules (hypothetical figures)`

-- Programme I: sum insured 100m, main limit 120m, medical expenses 20m.
`the Programme I cover` MEANS
    `The Programme I cover` WITH
        `the sum insured`                IS 100_000_000
        `the main limit`                 IS 120_000_000
        `the limit for medical expenses` IS 20_000_000

-- Programme II: main limit 200m; sub-limits that add up to 169m.
GIVEN `benefit 1 limit` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The Programme II cover`
`the Programme II cover, with a benefit 1 limit of` `benefit 1 limit` MEANS
    `The Programme II cover` WITH
        `the main limit`                             IS 200_000_000
        `the limit for benefit 1, hospitalisation`   IS `benefit 1 limit`
        `the limit on the bed, per day`              IS 1_000_000
        `the limit for benefit 2, surgery`           IS 60_000_000
        `the limit for benefit 3, organ transplant`  IS 40_000_000
        `the limit for costs before admission`       IS 5_000_000
        `the limit for treatment after discharge`    IS 5_000_000
        `the limit for home nursing`                 IS 3_000_000
        `the daily hospital allowance, per day`      IS 200_000
        `the limit for the daily hospital allowance` IS 6_000_000

`the Programme II cover` MEANS `the Programme II cover, with a benefit 1 limit of` 50_000_000

GIVEN p1 IS A BOOLEAN
      p2 IS A BOOLEAN
      op IS A BOOLEAN
      de IS A BOOLEAN
      ma IS A BOOLEAN
      inc IS A BOOLEAN
      b6 IS A BOOLEAN
      asia IS A BOOLEAN
      pe IS A BOOLEAN
      sd IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The schedule`
`a schedule with I:` p1 `, II:` p2 `, outpatient:` op `, dental:` de `, maternity:` ma `, income:` inc `, benefit 6:` b6 `, Asia:` asia `, pre-existing:` pe `, special:` sd MEANS
    `The schedule` WITH
        `Programme I`                                                 IS IF p1 THEN JUST `the Programme I cover` ELSE NOTHING
        `Programme II`                                                IS IF p2 THEN JUST `the Programme II cover` ELSE NOTHING
        `optional benefit 1, extension to the countries of Asia`      IS asia
        `optional benefit 2, outpatient treatment`                    IS IF op THEN JUST (`The outpatient cover` WITH `the limit per visit` IS 1_000_000, `the limit for the benefit` IS 10_000_000) ELSE NOTHING
        `benefit 3, dental treatment`                                 IS IF de THEN JUST (`The dental cover` WITH `the co-payment rate` IS 20, `the limit for the benefit` IS 5_000_000) ELSE NOTHING
        `benefit 4, maternity and childbirth`                         IS IF ma THEN JUST (`The maternity cover` WITH `the co-payment rate` IS 20, `the limit for the benefit` IS 30_000_000, `the limit for newborn care` IS 5_000_000) ELSE NOTHING
        `optional benefit 5, income allowance`                        IS IF inc THEN JUST (`The income allowance cover` WITH `the allowance per day` IS 300_000, `the limit for the benefit` IS 9_000_000) ELSE NOTHING
        `benefit 6, death and disablement from illness`               IS IF b6 THEN JUST (`The illness death and disablement cover` WITH `the sum insured` IS 50_000_000) ELSE NOTHING
        `extended to cover pre-existing conditions`                   IS pe
        `extended to cover special diseases`                          IS sd
        `the waiting period for illness the contract states, in days` IS NOTHING

`the full schedule` MEANS
    `a schedule with I:` TRUE `, II:` TRUE `, outpatient:` TRUE `, dental:` TRUE `, maternity:` TRUE `, income:` TRUE `, benefit 6:` TRUE `, Asia:` FALSE `, pre-existing:` FALSE `, special:` FALSE
`the full schedule, extended to Asia` MEANS
    `a schedule with I:` TRUE `, II:` TRUE `, outpatient:` TRUE `, dental:` TRUE `, maternity:` TRUE `, income:` TRUE `, benefit 6:` TRUE `, Asia:` TRUE `, pre-existing:` FALSE `, special:` FALSE
`the full schedule, extended for pre-existing conditions` MEANS
    `a schedule with I:` TRUE `, II:` TRUE `, outpatient:` TRUE `, dental:` TRUE `, maternity:` TRUE `, income:` TRUE `, benefit 6:` TRUE `, Asia:` FALSE `, pre-existing:` TRUE `, special:` FALSE
`the full schedule, extended for special diseases` MEANS
    `a schedule with I:` TRUE `, II:` TRUE `, outpatient:` TRUE `, dental:` TRUE `, maternity:` TRUE `, income:` TRUE `, benefit 6:` TRUE `, Asia:` FALSE `, pre-existing:` FALSE `, special:` TRUE
`the full schedule without outpatient cover` MEANS
    `a schedule with I:` TRUE `, II:` TRUE `, outpatient:` FALSE `, dental:` TRUE `, maternity:` TRUE `, income:` TRUE `, benefit 6:` TRUE `, Asia:` FALSE `, pre-existing:` FALSE `, special:` FALSE
`the full schedule without dental cover` MEANS
    `a schedule with I:` TRUE `, II:` TRUE `, outpatient:` TRUE `, dental:` FALSE `, maternity:` TRUE `, income:` TRUE `, benefit 6:` TRUE `, Asia:` FALSE `, pre-existing:` FALSE `, special:` FALSE
`the full schedule without maternity cover` MEANS
    `a schedule with I:` TRUE `, II:` TRUE `, outpatient:` TRUE `, dental:` TRUE `, maternity:` FALSE `, income:` TRUE `, benefit 6:` TRUE `, Asia:` FALSE `, pre-existing:` FALSE `, special:` FALSE
`Programme I alone` MEANS
    `a schedule with I:` TRUE `, II:` FALSE `, outpatient:` FALSE `, dental:` FALSE `, maternity:` FALSE `, income:` FALSE `, benefit 6:` FALSE `, Asia:` FALSE `, pre-existing:` FALSE `, special:` FALSE
`Programme II alone` MEANS
    `a schedule with I:` FALSE `, II:` TRUE `, outpatient:` FALSE `, dental:` FALSE `, maternity:` FALSE `, income:` FALSE `, benefit 6:` FALSE `, Asia:` FALSE `, pre-existing:` FALSE `, special:` FALSE

-- The full schedule with a different limit for benefit 1 (for a renewal at a higher option).
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The schedule`
`the full schedule, with a benefit 1 limit of` n MEANS
    `The schedule` WITH
        `Programme I`                                                 IS JUST `the Programme I cover`
        `Programme II`                                                IS JUST (`the Programme II cover, with a benefit 1 limit of` n)
        `optional benefit 1, extension to the countries of Asia`      IS FALSE
        `optional benefit 2, outpatient treatment`                    IS `the full schedule`'s `optional benefit 2, outpatient treatment`
        `benefit 3, dental treatment`                                 IS `the full schedule`'s `benefit 3, dental treatment`
        `benefit 4, maternity and childbirth`                         IS `the full schedule`'s `benefit 4, maternity and childbirth`
        `optional benefit 5, income allowance`                        IS `the full schedule`'s `optional benefit 5, income allowance`
        `benefit 6, death and disablement from illness`               IS `the full schedule`'s `benefit 6, death and disablement from illness`
        `extended to cover pre-existing conditions`                   IS FALSE
        `extended to cover special diseases`                          IS FALSE
        `the waiting period for illness the contract states, in days` IS NOTHING

-- The full schedule, with a 60-day waiting period for illness written on the contract.
`the full schedule, with a 60-day waiting period for illness` MEANS
    `The schedule` WITH
        `Programme I`                                                 IS JUST `the Programme I cover`
        `Programme II`                                                IS JUST `the Programme II cover`
        `optional benefit 1, extension to the countries of Asia`      IS FALSE
        `optional benefit 2, outpatient treatment`                    IS `the full schedule`'s `optional benefit 2, outpatient treatment`
        `benefit 3, dental treatment`                                 IS `the full schedule`'s `benefit 3, dental treatment`
        `benefit 4, maternity and childbirth`                         IS `the full schedule`'s `benefit 4, maternity and childbirth`
        `optional benefit 5, income allowance`                        IS `the full schedule`'s `optional benefit 5, income allowance`
        `benefit 6, death and disablement from illness`               IS `the full schedule`'s `benefit 6, death and disablement from illness`
        `extended to cover pre-existing conditions`                   IS FALSE
        `extended to cover special diseases`                          IS FALSE
        `the waiting period for illness the contract states, in days` IS JUST 60

§§ `Policies`

GIVEN s IS A `The schedule`
GIVETH A `The policy`
`a first-year policy on` s MEANS
    `The policy` WITH
        `the schedule`                                       IS s
        `the schedule for the previous period`               IS NOTHING
        `date of joining`                                    IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `first day of the period, as the certificate states` IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `last day of the period, as the certificate states`  IS YMD 2026 12 31
        `date PTI received the premium in full`              IS YMD 2025 12 20
        `renewed continuously`                               IS FALSE
        `the annual premium`                                 IS 12_000_000

-- Joined on 1 January 2023 and renewed every year since; the current period is 2026.
GIVEN s IS A `The schedule`
      prev IS A `The schedule`
GIVETH A `The policy`
`a policy renewed continuously since 2023, now on` s `, last year on` prev MEANS
    `The policy` WITH
        `the schedule`                                       IS s
        `the schedule for the previous period`               IS JUST prev
        `date of joining`                                    IS YMD 2023 1 1
        `first day of the period, as the certificate states` IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `last day of the period, as the certificate states`  IS YMD 2026 12 31
        `date PTI received the premium in full`              IS YMD 2025 12 20
        `renewed continuously`                               IS TRUE
        `the annual premium`                                 IS 12_000_000

GIVEN s IS A `The schedule`
GIVETH A `The policy`
`a policy renewed continuously since 2023 on` s MEANS
    `a policy renewed continuously since 2023, now on` s `, last year on` s

-- A first-year policy whose premium arrived on 5 January 2026: cover from 6 January.
`a first-year policy paid late` MEANS
    `The policy` WITH
        `the schedule`                                       IS `the full schedule`
        `the schedule for the previous period`               IS NOTHING
        `date of joining`                                    IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `first day of the period, as the certificate states` IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `last day of the period, as the certificate states`  IS YMD 2026 12 31
        `date PTI received the premium in full`              IS YMD 2026 1 5
        `renewed continuously`                               IS FALSE
        `the annual premium`                                 IS 12_000_000

`the standard policy` MEANS `a first-year policy on` `the full schedule`

§§ `Stays, illnesses, accidents, disablements`

GIVEN adm IS A DATE
      dis IS A DATE
      hrs IS A NUMBER
      admitted IS A BOOLEAN
      overnight IS A BOOLEAN
      pl IS A `The place of treatment`
GIVETH A `The hospital stay`
`a stay from` adm `to` dis `, hours` hrs `, admitted` admitted `, overnight` overnight `, at` pl MEANS
    `The hospital stay` WITH
        `date of admission`                                   IS adm
        `date of discharge`                                   IS dis
        `hours in hospital`                                   IS hrs
        `admitted through the hospital's admission procedure` IS admitted
        `in a hospital bed overnight`                         IS overnight
        `the place`                                           IS pl

-- 1 to 3 March 2026: three days, 50 hours, admitted, overnight, in Vietnam.
`the standard stay` MEANS
    `a stay from` (YMD 2026 3 1) `to` (YMD 2026 3 3) `, hours` 50 `, admitted` TRUE `, overnight` TRUE `, at` `a hospital in Vietnam`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      g IS A `A country group`
GIVETH A `The illness`
`an illness that began on` d `in` g MEANS
    `The illness` WITH
        `the date it began`                                                        IS d
        `where it arose`                                                           IS g
        `dates on which it was treated before`                                     IS EMPTY
        `the date the insured person first knew of its symptoms or of the illness` IS NOTHING
        `its marks`                                                                IS EMPTY
        `a competent authority has given a clear conclusion on the pathology`      IS TRUE
        `the direct cause of the death or the disablement`                         IS TRUE

`the standard illness` MEANS `an illness that began on` (YMD 2026 2 25) `in` `Vietnam`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      k IS A `A kind of accident`
GIVETH A `The accident`
`an accident on` d `of the kind` k MEANS
    `The accident` WITH
        `the date`                                                       IS d
        `where it happened`                                              IS `Vietnam`
        `sudden`                                                         IS TRUE
        `caused by an external and visible force on the body`            IS TRUE
        `outside the insured person's will and control`                  IS TRUE
        `the direct cause of the death or the injury`                    IS TRUE
        `the injury was the first consequence of the accident`           IS TRUE
        `the injury was an accumulation of accidents or injuries`        IS FALSE
        `the injury was caused, directly or indirectly, by the aggravation of a weakness, defect, degeneration or illness that existed before cover began` IS FALSE
        `the injury was caused solely by the accident, not by illness, declining health or nerves, time or age` IS TRUE
        `the kind`                                                       IS k
        `serious`                                                        IS FALSE
        `a third party was involved`                                     IS FALSE

`the standard accident` MEANS `an accident on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `of the kind` `an accident in daily life`

GIVEN began IS A DATE
      weeks IS A NUMBER
      `TPD listed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `PPD rate` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `The disablement`
`a disablement from` began `lasting` weeks `weeks, listed as total:` `TPD listed` `, partial rate:` `PPD rate` MEANS
    `The disablement` WITH
        `the date it began`                                                         IS began
        `weeks it has lasted without a break`                                       IS weeks
        `listed in the total permanent disablement section of the table`            IS `TPD listed`
        `the rate the table gives in its partial permanent disablement section, in per cent` IS `PPD rate`
        `complete loss of the ability to do daily activities, or of the capacity for any kind of work` IS TRUE
        `permanent loss of part of the capacity for work through amputation, loss, loss of use or partial paralysis of a part of the body` IS TRUE
        `present medicine cannot remedy it`                                         IS TRUE
        `no hope of improvement`                                                    IS TRUE
        `a complete physical and mental change leaving the person unable to meet any personal, social or work need, or any legal requirement` IS TRUE

§§ `Events`

GIVEN cause IS A `A cause`
      acc IS A MAYBE `The accident`
      ill IS A MAYBE `The illness`
      ds IS A LIST OF `A condition named in the Rules`
      cs IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in Part 3`
      st IS A MAYBE `The hospital stay`
GIVETH A `The event`
`an event: cause` cause `, accident` acc `, illness` ill `, diagnoses` ds `, circumstances` cs `, stay` st MEANS
    `The event` WITH
        `the cause`                                IS cause
        `the accident`                             IS acc
        `the illness`                              IS ill
        `the conditions diagnosed`                 IS ds
        `the circumstances`                        IS cs
        `the sporting activity`                    IS NOTHING
        `the hospital stay`                        IS st
        `the date of death`                        IS NOTHING
        `the cause of death unknown`               IS FALSE
        `the disablement`                          IS NOTHING
        `the date the surgery was first ordered`   IS NOTHING
        `the date of the outpatient diagnosis`     IS NOTHING

GIVEN ds IS A LIST OF `A condition named in the Rules`
      cs IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in Part 3`
GIVETH A `The event`
`an illness, with diagnoses` ds `and circumstances` cs `, and the standard stay` MEANS
    `an event: cause` `an illness` `, accident` NOTHING `, illness` (JUST `the standard illness`) `, diagnoses` ds `, circumstances` cs `, stay` (JUST `the standard stay`)

`the standard illness event` MEANS
    `an illness, with diagnoses` (LIST `a condition the Rules do not name`) `and circumstances` EMPTY `, and the standard stay`

GIVEN st IS A `The hospital stay`
GIVETH A `The event`
`an illness, with the stay` st MEANS
    `an event: cause` `an illness` `, accident` NOTHING `, illness` (JUST `the standard illness`) `, diagnoses` (LIST `a condition the Rules do not name`) `, circumstances` EMPTY `, stay` (JUST st)

`the standard accident event` MEANS
    `an event: cause` `an accident` `, accident` (JUST `the standard accident`) `, illness` NOTHING `, diagnoses` EMPTY `, circumstances` EMPTY `, stay` (JUST `the standard stay`)

§§ `Lines`

GIVEN b IS A `A benefit`
      h IS A `A head of cost`
      d IS A DATE
      amt IS A NUMBER
      ts IS A LIST OF `A treatment named in the Rules`
GIVETH A `A claim item`
`a line under` b `for` h `on` d `of` amt `involving` ts MEANS
    `A claim item` WITH
        `the benefit`                                  IS b
        `the head of cost`                             IS h
        `the date`                                     IS d
        `the amount charged`                           IS amt
        `the reasonable and customary amount`          IS amt
        `the treatments it involves`                   IS ts
        `the order`                                    IS JUST `a licensed doctor`
        `given during the hospital stay`               IS TRUE
        `the place of treatment`                       IS `a hospital in Vietnam`
        `directly related to the illness or injury for which the insured person was then admitted` IS TRUE
        `the insured person was in a critical condition threatening life and needing emergency treatment` IS FALSE
        `the main benefit it belongs to`               IS NOTHING
        `the visit`                                    IS 0
        `a visit to one specialty of one medical establishment, with tests or diagnostics, a specific diagnosis and a doctor's order for treatment` IS TRUE
        `the prescription was paid once already`       IS FALSE

GIVEN b IS A `A benefit`
      h IS A `A head of cost`
      d IS A DATE
      amt IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim item`
`a line under` b `for` h `on` d `of` amt MEANS
    `a line under` b `for` h `on` d `of` amt `involving` EMPTY

-- A line given OUTSIDE the hospital stay, at a place, with or without a doctor's order.
GIVEN b IS A `A benefit`
      h IS A `A head of cost`
      d IS A DATE
      amt IS A NUMBER
      pl IS A `The place of treatment`
      o IS A MAYBE `The doctor who gave the order`
GIVETH A `A claim item`
`an outside line under` b `for` h `on` d `of` amt `at` pl `, ordered by` o MEANS
    `A claim item` WITH
        `the benefit`                                  IS b
        `the head of cost`                             IS h
        `the date`                                     IS d
        `the amount charged`                           IS amt
        `the reasonable and customary amount`          IS amt
        `the treatments it involves`                   IS EMPTY
        `the order`                                    IS o
        `given during the hospital stay`               IS FALSE
        `the place of treatment`                       IS pl
        `directly related to the illness or injury for which the insured person was then admitted` IS TRUE
        `the insured person was in a critical condition threatening life and needing emergency treatment` IS FALSE
        `the main benefit it belongs to`               IS NOTHING
        `the visit`                                    IS 1
        `a visit to one specialty of one medical establishment, with tests or diagnostics, a specific diagnosis and a doctor's order for treatment` IS TRUE
        `the prescription was paid once already`       IS FALSE

GIVEN b IS A `A benefit`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A claim item`
`a fixed-sum line under` b `on` d MEANS
    `a line under` b `for` `a fixed sum, not a cost` `on` d `of` 0

§§ `Filing and claims`

-- Notified on 10 March 2026 and filed on 20 March 2026; nothing further asked for.
`a filing in time` MEANS
    `The filing of the claim` WITH
        `the date PTI was notified`                     IS JUST (YMD 2026 3 10)
        `the date the claim file was submitted`         IS JUST (YMD 2026 3 20)
        `the date PTI asked for more documents`         IS NOTHING
        `the date the further documents were submitted` IS NOTHING
        `prevented by force majeure`                    IS FALSE
        `the documents submitted`                       IS EMPTY
        `an invoice gives only a combined total`        IS FALSE

GIVEN p IS A `The insured person`
      pol IS A `The policy`
      e IS A `The event`
      lines IS A LIST OF `A claim item`
GIVETH A `The claim`
`a claim by` p `under` pol `for` e `with the lines` lines MEANS
    `The claim` WITH
        `the insured person`                    IS p
        `the policy`                            IS pol
        `the event`                             IS e
        `the items`                             IS lines
        `the filing`                            IS `a filing in time`
        `other insurance`                       IS NOTHING
        `already counted earlier in the period` IS EMPTY

GIVEN it IS A `A claim item`
      c IS A `The claim`
GIVETH AN `An item of a claim`
`the line` it `in` c MEANS
    `An item of a claim` WITH `the claim` IS c, `the item` IS it

-- The outcome of one line, read in a claim, with what the claim says was counted before.
GIVEN it IS A `A claim item`
      c IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A `The outcome for an item`
`the outcome of the line` it `in` c MEANS
    `the outcome for` (`the line` it `in` c) `, given what was counted before:` (c's `already counted earlier in the period`)

-- The standard case: the standard person, policy and illness event, with one line.
GIVEN it IS A `A claim item`
GIVETH A `The claim`
`the standard claim for` it MEANS
    `a claim by` `the insured person` `under` `the standard policy` `for` `the standard illness event` `with the lines` (LIST it)

GIVEN it IS A `A claim item`
GIVETH AN `An item of a claim`
`the standard case of` it MEANS
    `the line` it `in` (`the standard claim for` it)

GIVEN it IS A `A claim item`
GIVETH A `The outcome for an item`
`the standard outcome of` it MEANS
    `the outcome of the line` it `in` (`the standard claim for` it)

-- A clean benefit-1 line: medicines during the standard stay, 1 March 2026, 2m.
`a clean benefit 1 line` MEANS
    `a line under` `Programme II benefit 1: hospitalisation for illness` `for` `(I) medicines used during the hospital stay` `on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `of` 2_000_000
